WEBVTT

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:13.700
It's been almost a century since Apollo landed on the Moon, and the first wooden ship, the von Braun, was about to take off.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:22.940
Wearing the dreams and ambitions of mankind.

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:29.260
Not yet?

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:30.000
I'm sorry.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.620
He was a member of the space defense war, Hakima Shimido.

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:43.240
From the beginning, he aimed for von Blanc and took the test.

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:51.750
There was a terrorist attack on the communication satellite ISPV7.

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:56.750
As a result of the investigation, it was found that he was leaking security information.

00:00:56.750 --> 00:01:00.000
From the time I joined the Mobile Security Agency, I've been a terrorist.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.000
That's right. He is...

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.600
He failed to destroy Von Braun and is still on the run.

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:09.890
- Probably... - Why?

00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:14.290
Why didn't it come up?

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:23.270
That guy's nickname...

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:32.190
The sound of the wind is beyond time.

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:34.020
I see a dream.

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:59.030
In the silence of the sky, I see the light.

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:00.000
Why would I get kicked out?

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:02.650
It's the rule to go back and forth on the same crew!

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:03.940
I don't get it!

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:06.120
I'm telling you to cool your head!

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:09.870
I don't know why you're so irritated, but you've been acting weird lately.

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:11.430
Weird? What do you mean weird?!

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:13.090
That's it, that's it!

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:16.070
You're not the kind of person to raise your voice like that!

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:16.610
Ah...

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:20.820
At this rate, you won't be able to entrust the lives of others to you.

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:23.690
That's my judgment as the captain.

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:25.380
Study hard on the cargo ship.

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:26.280
Hey.

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:46.550
You're talking about me, aren't you?

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:48.350
What are you going to do when I talk to you?

00:03:48.350 --> 00:03:50.680
I'm me. You're you, aren't you?

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:55.810
Oh, my God, Tanabe.

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:57.710
Because of the highest-ranking committee of the Federation,

00:03:57.710 --> 00:03:59.510
The procedure is complicated.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:09.990
It seems that the chief's regular flight will be delayed a little, so even if I go up first today, I'll ask for it.

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:16.390
Did you call the security company?

00:04:16.390 --> 00:04:18.930
That's the security guard at the board meeting, and he's paying for it.

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:20.330
