00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:33.940
Yes, I understand.

00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:35.840
Ah...

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:41.770
There are a lot of things in this world that you don't know that are black and dirty.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:53.550
The second class is supporting Debricka.

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:55.500
Yes, it's over there in the elevator.

00:06:55.500 --> 00:07:00.000
