00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:43.780
We'll be late from now on.

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:47.500
You see, a proper office like this is noisy even in the daytime.

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:50.460
Then I'll go buy it, so you go ahead, Chief.

00:07:50.460 --> 00:07:52.040
I don't want to be alone.

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:53.700
Then I'll go buy it.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.840
No, you can't let the Chief go.

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:57.260
No, no, I'll do it.

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:58.380
No, I'll do it.

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:00.000
