00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:11.000
Thank you.

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:11.880
Adel!

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:07.080
Is this the teacher?

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:18.540
If you're looking at this, you're probably dead.

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:21.840
What is it?

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:25.660
For a space pilot, it's like a occupational disease.

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:28.100
That's what space is.

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:38.480
I heard my teacher, Harry Roland, also died here.

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:41.080
The universe is cold, isn't it?

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:42.480
It's cruel, isn't it?

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:43.990
I can't catch it.

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:47.220
But I get attracted to it, don't I?

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:51.020
Like a pure man who fell in love with a little girl.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:55.000
Well, this is also a weakling who fell in love.

00:19:58.140 --> 00:20:00.000
By the way, you...

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:03.720
I heard that you are going to take the exam for von Braun.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:06.210
I heard it from Akim.

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:07.480
Ahh...

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:09.910
He is tough, isn't he?

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:11.880
He will be your good rival.

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:17.120
Ah, and finally, I will tell you something important.

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:19.810
A ship needs a harbor.

00:20:19.810 --> 00:20:25.070
He will wait for you forever, and in the end, he will accept you.

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:27.700
Such a harbor...

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:28.670
Remember it.

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:29.980
Then, I will go to Goro.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.840
Shiku, he's a little shy.

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:38.010
Be nice to him.

00:20:38.010 --> 00:20:45.890
It's me.

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:52.360
Mr. Niide, a member of the family.

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:54.740
Please come to the pharmacy immediately.

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:02.940
I want to talk to you.

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:04.900
Everyone is worried.

00:21:04.900 --> 00:21:07.040
I don't know what they're doing because I don't get a call.

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:11.900
Um, senpai.

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:15.080
That's a lie, isn't it?

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:18.880
I'm too lonely to be alone.

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:20.930
The teacher...

00:21:20.930 --> 00:21:23.750
Kigaruto sensei...

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:25.030
That's not...

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:26.500
It's okay.

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:29.220
Not yet?

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:40.240
Tanabe, did you say that the doctor had cancer?

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:43.410
Um...

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:49.970
What did I say?

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:03.830
But that's an excuse, isn't it?

00:22:03.830 --> 00:22:05.970
People and stars don't change.

00:22:05.970 --> 00:22:09.080
They're just floating in the vast universe.

00:22:09.080 --> 00:22:11.140
I'm sorry, Senpai.

00:22:11.140 --> 00:22:13.410
I'm sad and lonely.

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:15.870
I think I'm angry.

00:22:15.870 --> 00:22:17.950
Even between you and Tanabe,

00:22:17.950 --> 00:22:21.220
a cold, cruel, dark universe is expanding.

00:22:21.220 --> 00:22:26.830
But I think you can make it a little lighter by getting to know each other.

00:22:26.830 --> 00:22:29.920
It's hard on your own.

00:22:30.440 --> 00:22:36.090
And you will realize that you will die alone after all.

00:22:36.090 --> 00:22:37.090
Like GIGALT...

00:22:37.090 --> 00:22:38.420
Senpai!

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:42.130
Shut up!

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:43.430
It's my turn!

00:22:43.430 --> 00:22:51.580
I don't want to be sad, upset, or regret!

00:22:51.580 --> 00:22:55.090
Can you do it? Can you do it?

00:23:13.340 --> 00:23:23.560
The stars are different

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:40.660
Even if I fall down, I'll be sure to

00:24:33.160 --> 00:24:35.160
There is an error in the general communication channel.

00:24:35.160 --> 00:24:38.060
The range of the moon orbit is one, and it is thought to be a multidirectional interference.

00:24:38.060 --> 00:24:40.060
Is it a problem with the network itself?

00:24:40.060 --> 00:24:40.530
That's right.

00:24:40.530 --> 00:24:45.730
Is there any information about this problem from the anti-earth-to-earth Navstar Line?

00:24:45.730 --> 00:24:48.430
There is an influence on the nuclear power line, and it is under investigation.

00:24:48.430 --> 00:24:52.540
There is definitely an error in the communication network of the Navstar, and it is a problem with the earth orbit.

00:24:52.540 --> 00:24:55.380
Then, shall we all go to the ice crater?

00:25:36.590 --> 00:25:40.760
I'm sorry.
